  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to One UN Vietnam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to One UN Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till &quot;One UN Initiative in Vietnam&quot;. S&#xf6;det betalas ut 2008 men avser aktiviter under 2009-2010.St&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att etablera &quot;One UN&quot; som ska fungera som ett &quot;tak&quot; till alla FN-organ som arbetar i Vietnam. Vietnam &#xe4;r det land som kommit l&#xe4;ngst i genomf&#xf6;randet av en plan, en budget. osv.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the One UN Iniative in Vietnam. The support will be disbursed during 2008 but pertains to 2009-2010. The aim is to create One UN as an umbrella for all UN agencies in Vietnam. The aim is also to have one plan, one budget, streamline staff policies. Vietnam is one of five pilots in the world.</narrative>
  </description>
